      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在那之后我们两人一起品尝了热巧克力。\n收到意想不到的回礼\n似乎令她相当满足。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7edcf52a10b10b4ae3c55eda7cfdc8ebaf8e99875caaf376e183cd057df91ad2",
